      "note": "Counts the biology, chemistry/physics, quantitative-literacy and other science tags (plus BIO-AS, PBS-HE, PHS-AS, SDS-AS), MATH 1100+ and CHEM or PHYS 1100+ worth 3+ credits. FWS, 1000-1099, 4960-4999, PE and AP/IB/placement credit never count. Quantitative literacy is its own row below. Variable-credit CHEM/PHYS courses are left out, so this can read short.",
      "kind": "pool",
      "rule": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "not": {
              "number": {
                "min": 1000,
                "max": 1099
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "not": {
              "number": {
                "min": 4960,
                "max": 4999
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "not": {
              "subject": [
                "PE"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
